{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達在管理層發生重大變動後，正式調整其中國市場策略。當地時間11月17日，英偉達代理行政總裁科萊特·克雷斯在公司財報電話會議上宣佈，英偉達將不再向中國銷售H200人工智能加速晶片，這意味着公司將結束此前利用特殊安排繼續向中國市場供應先進AI晶片的做法。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586886.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:26:51.179141+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:10:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_hash":"efa4b4a25b3a261f30cb3700e26ae17d68123491a27494e03a367a28fbe02174","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}